    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in either player's Fight phase, right after an enemy unit selects its targets. Pick 1 **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN CHARACTER** unit of yours that is a target of 1 or more of those attacks.\n\nFor the rest of that phase, whenever 1 of your unit's models is destroyed, if it has not yet fought this phase, roll a D6, adding 1 if the unit is the Favoured Champions of your army. If the result is 4+, the model stays in play until the attacking unit completes its attacks; it can then fight, and is removed afterwards.",
